# KN-010: An iodine clock separates production from visible accumulation
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.004mol
add v1 KI 0.005mol
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.00002mol
add v1 H2O2 0.005mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
add v2 KI 0.005mol
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.0001mol
add v2 H2O2 0.005mol
wait 5s
inspect
wait 10s
inspect
wait 30s
inspect
